  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "26db7620-09df-462f-b00d-daeed7d4fc89",
    "name": "Partner API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "This API allows users from Partner Relationship Management (PRM) systems and partner portals to securely access DealHub's CPQ functionality. The integration follows a two-request flow:\n1.  **Authentication (Server-to-Server):** The PRM system makes a server-side call to `/api/v1/authenticate/user` using a long-lived secret key to get a short-lived (60 seconds) one-time access token for a specific partner user.\n2.  **Open DealHub CPQ (Client-Side):** The PRM's client-side application uses the one-time access token to make a request to a DealHub endpoint (e.g., `/api/v1/create/quote`). DealHub returns a unique URL. The PRM should then redirect the user's browser to this URL, giving them a seamless and authenticated session in the DealHub portal.",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
}